                                <div style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 2pt;">AUTHORIZED SIGNATORY</div>
                                <div style="font-size: 9pt; color: #666;">(Party 2)</div>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                        
